; Machine IR: the project-owned representation below the CFG form of the SSA
; IR. Pure schema, types, program containers, builder, verifier and printer;
; no interpreter, target, allocator, Unix, Bigarray or emitter. It sees only
; [core], [err_trace], [expr] (the language's neutral identities: axes,
; sources, local variables) and [fmt]. See the Machine IR design in .ai/.
;
; Wrapped (default): consumers write [Machine_ir.Mir_op].

(library
 (name machine_ir)
 (libraries core err_trace expr fmt))
